      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There is a few features that are similar to this\nIn Invite, Invite+, and Friends instances, the instance owner can warn and kick players.\nand for the tags, there is already a user ranking called \"Nuisance\" which autoblocks every feature of the player in user safety settings for them.",
