  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-09-06T21:52:39.415Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Bad users are actively crossing the line more and more and complain when they're banned \"for no reason\". \nThey throw tantrums when they get banned and start telling other users that moderation is trash, these people are old enough not to be throwing tantrums. \n\nThe Karens of VRChat have too much power \n\nModerators can start sending out these warnings telling people to stop it or delete the content before logging in. Adding the possible troll tag can prevent the user from uploading content. This is especially applicable to VRC+ users, they cannot feign ignorance of worsening the game for everyone",
